---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Redactoria EDU"
	description="Redactoria EDU — uporządkowana wiedza o programowaniu, web developmencie i AI."
>
	<div class="landing">
		<div class="glow glow--top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="glow glow--bottom" aria-hidden="true"></div>

		<section class="hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">Wiedza, która rozwija się razem z technologią</p>
			<h1>Witamy w<br /><em>Redactoria</em></h1>
			<p class="intro">
				Budujemy czytelną bazę wiedzy o programowaniu, web developmencie<br class="desktop" />{' '}
				i sztucznej inteligencji.
			</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="actions__primary" href="/artykuly/">Zobacz artykuły</a>
				<a href="/o-projekcie/">Poznaj projekt</a>
			</div>
			<div class="line" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
			<section class="discovery" aria-label="Odkryj Redactorię">
				<article>
					<span class="discovery__number">01 / Czytaj</span>
					<h2>Artykuły</h2>
					<p>Poznaj materiały edukacyjne Redactorii EDU. Zaczynamy od programowania i praktycznych tematów technicznych, rozwijanych stopniowo w spójną bazę wiedzy.</p>
					<a href="/artykuly/">Artykuły <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span class="discovery__number">02 / Odkrywaj</span>
					<h2>Tematy</h2>
					<p>Przeglądaj wiedzę według obszarów i zobacz, jak artykuły łączą się w większe ścieżki. Z czasem ta sekcja ma wspierać poruszanie się po całej mapie wiedzy.</p>
					<a href="/tematy/">Tematy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
				<article>
					<span class="discovery__number">03 / Poznaj</span>
					<h2>Redactoria</h2>
					<p>Dowiedz się, czym jest Redactoria EDU, jak działa nasz proces tworzenia treści oraz dlaczego oddzielamy SOURCE, LAB, CONTENT i WEBSITE.</p>
					<a href="/o-projekcie/">O projekcie <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
			</section>
		</section>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.landing {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		min-height: calc(100svh - 10rem);
		align-items: center;
		overflow: hidden;
		isolation: isolate;
	}

	.landing::before {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: -2;
		background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(39, 37, 31, 0.12) 0.6px, transparent 0.6px);
		background-size: 5px 5px;
		content: '';
		opacity: 0.18;
	}

	.glow {
		position: absolute;
		z-index: -1;
		width: 42rem;
		height: 42rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		filter: blur(2px);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.glow--top {
		top: -28rem;
		right: -10rem;
		background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(202, 116, 80, 0.2), transparent 68%);
	}

	.glow--bottom {
		bottom: -30rem;
		left: -8rem;
		background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(111, 139, 119, 0.18), transparent 68%);
	}

	.hero {
		width: min(100% - (2 * var(--page-gutter)), var(--content-width));
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding-block: clamp(5rem, 12vh, 9rem);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
		color: var(--color-subtle);
		font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 1vw, 0.76rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 9rem);
		font-weight: 400;
		letter-spacing: -0.065em;
		line-height: 0.82;
	}

	h1 em {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.intro {
		margin: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem) auto 0;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.7vw, 1.3rem);
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.8rem;
	}

	.actions a {
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 750;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-decoration: none;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.actions a:hover {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.actions .actions__primary {
		background: var(--color-ink);
		color: var(--color-canvas);
	}

	.actions .actions__primary:hover {
		background: var(--color-accent);
		color: #fff;
	}

	.line {
		width: min(12rem, 38vw);
		height: 1px;
		margin: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4rem) auto 0;
		background: var(--color-line);
	}

	.line span {
		display: block;
		width: 35%;
		height: 100%;
		margin: auto;
		background: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.discovery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin-top: 4rem; text-align: left; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
	.discovery article { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; padding: 2rem; border-right: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
	.discovery article:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
	.discovery article:last-child { padding-right: 0; border-right: 0; }
	.discovery__number { color: var(--color-subtle); font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.discovery h2 { margin: 1rem 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.045em; }
	.discovery p { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.75; }
	.discovery a { margin-top: auto; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
	.discovery a span { display: inline-block; margin-left: 0.5rem; transition: transform 150ms ease; }
	.discovery a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.25em; }
	.discovery a:hover span { transform: translate(2px, -2px); }
	.discovery__note { margin: 1rem 0 0; color: var(--color-subtle); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: left; }

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.desktop {
			display: none;
		}

		.hero {
			padding-block: 4rem;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 19vw, 6rem);
			line-height: 0.88;
		}

		.intro {
			max-width: 20rem;
		}
		.discovery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 3rem; }
		.discovery article, .discovery article:first-child, .discovery article:last-child { padding: 1.75rem 0; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .discovery a span { transition: none; } }

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
		.eyebrow,
		h1,
		.intro,
		.actions,
		.line {
			opacity: 0;
			animation: reveal 0.8s ease forwards;
		}

		h1 { animation-delay: 0.08s; }
		.intro { animation-delay: 0.18s; }
		.actions { animation-delay: 0.26s; }
		.line { animation-delay: 0.34s; }
	}

	@keyframes reveal {
		from {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateY(12px);
		}
		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}
	}
</style>
